FILE: rename.rs
MOD: commands/rename
OWNS: module ID migration — rewrites MOD: occurrences across all .llmcode files
PROFILE: [io]
CHANGE-FREQUENCY: stable

run: &str * &str → Result<(), String> [io]
  note: loads ArchContext with .ok() — warns and proceeds if system.arch is missing or invalid

DEPENDS-ON: context, llmcode

KEY-INVARIANTS:
- CNTR: left/right module references are NOT rewritten — only MOD: lines; authors must fix CNTR: references manually after rename
- rename proceeds even when arch validate would fail (fail-soft context load by design)

